Post’ voting system.\n\n🔹A 65 year-old age limit for politicians including the senate and term limits.\n\n🔹Replace Senate appointments with elections and term limits.\n\n🔹Write into law all politicians in Canada must be born in Canada with no political or financial ties to any other country.\n\n🔹Politicians who are elected on promises should have an allocated time to enact or face Non-Confidence.\n\n🔹Would-be politicians should be made to take an aptitude/IQ test before running for any office.\n\n🔹Politicians should have a background, degree, etc., before being appointed to any position in Cabinet - Finance Minister should have a background in finance, Education Minister a former Scholar for example.\n\n🔹Write into law that all politicians and/or persons with power no matter the office or institution (PM, MP’s, Governor General, Judges, Police, etc.,) be held accountable by punishment of law for any wrongdoing, misconduct, corruption, ethics violations, etc.\n\n🔹Reduced the size of government. Civil servants in the Federal government grew more than 43 per cent from 257,034 people in 2015 to 367,772 in 2024.\n\n🔹Bring back Freedom of Speech and scrap Bill C-63 aka ‘the Online Harms Act’.\n\n🔹Revamp the greedy and unfair Taxation System.\n\n🔹A Canada First initiative were all TAX dollars stay and are used in Canada - No more foreign aid.\n\n🔹Pause immigration for as long as it takes for Housing, Healthcare and Education Systems to catch up to the current situation. Then impose responsible and vetted immigration only at a pace which Housing, Healthcare and Education Systems can absorb.\n\n🔹Only admit English and/or French speaking educated and skilled immigrants under the age of 45 and in good health with no criminal background - no background check no entry.\n\n🔹Immigrants have 5 years to prove they have/are contributing to Canada by their work etc., or face deportation.\n\n🔹Round up every illegal and ship them out. Mass deportation is required and long overdue.\n\n🔹Build a proper state of the art border and defend. Drones, motion sensors, camera surveillance, dogs, etc. \n\n🔹Rebuild the military by building all military ships, aircraft, gear, munitions, etc.\n\n🔹Minor offence convicts sentenced between 1 and 2 years automatically serve the military if physically and mentally able. Sentenced to less than 1 year works planting/picking on farms, etc., - removing the need for ‘migrant workers’ and minimum security facilities.\n\n🔹Build super-max prisons and overhaul the criminal justice system.\n\n🔹Minimum 5 year sentence for committing a crime using a gun and no bail. 15 years for second offence. 25 years for third. Smuggling firearms into Canada - life without the possibility of parole.\n\n🔹Mandatory life sentence in solitary confinement without the possibility of parole for human trafficking.\n\n🔹Automatic deportation for any immigrant breaking laws.\n\n🔹Rewrite the Young Offenders Act.\n\n🔹Repeal existing firearms laws and rewrite the Firearms Act.\n\n🔹Promote and teach proper firearms safety, laws and history beginning in elementary school. Respect and understanding of firearms will help reduce crime in our youth.\n\n🔹Introduce a Self-defence and Castle Law where Canadians are permitted to protect themselves, their family and their property by any means necessary - it’s time the justice system worked for the innocent instead of the criminal.\n\n🔹Enforce the ‘face coverings while protesting’ law and end all prayer in public places.\n\n🔹Abolish the Monarchy.\n\n🔹End international adoption - there are more than enough Canadian children in need of a loving family.\n\n🔹Remove so-called ‘wokeness’ from all institutions including the education system.\n\n🔹There are ONLY TWO genders.\n\n🔹End bailouts, subsidies and corporate welfare for billionaire corporations (General Motors, Rogers, Bell, Air Canada, etc.,)\n\n🔹Refine all our own oil & gas and natural resources.\n\n🔹End foreign investing where countries and/or companies from other countries are permitted to purchase our mines, land, natural resources, highways, buildings, etc.\n\n🔹Ban tobacco use for anyone born after a certain date for life. It will continue to be legal for anyone born before the same date ensuring smoking will eventually die out with time.\n\n🔹Force insurance companies to end unfair rates due to location or postal code.\n\n🔹Force communications companies to end unfair rates.\n\n🔹Only 3 flags should be flown over Canadian soil. The National Flag. The Provincial Flag. And the Municipal Flag. No other nation’s flag should ever be permitted to be flown over Canadian soil other than at their embassies or consulates. You are either Canadian and support Canada or you are not - in which case you leave.\n\n🇨🇦Begin recognizing and embracing Canada’s history and culture again. Good and bad. We learn from history and it shouldn’t be ‘erased’. It’s who we are.🇨🇦', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 2, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Wed Jan 01 05:15:36 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1874323567766364410', 'display_text_range': [0, 272], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/DYMpX1Vnrm', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/CaptainCanuck22/status/1874323567766364410/video/1', 'id_str': '1874323316132986880', 'indices': [273, 296], 'media_key': '7_1874323316132986880', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1874323316132986880/pu/img/JCAlOkujf6YDyeT8.jpg', 'type': 'video', 'url': 'https://t.co/DYMpX1Vnrm', 'additional_media_info': {'monetizable': False}, 'ext_media_availability': {'status': 'Available'}, 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 720, 'w': 1280, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'medium': {'h': 675, 'w': 1200, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'small': {'h': 383, 'w': 680, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'thumb': {'h': 150, 'w': 150, 'resize': 'crop'}}, 'original_info': {'he